# Generated protobuf sources — regenerated at build time in each build system
# (xmake on the ygoenv side invokes its own protoc via add_rules("protobuf.cpp");
# premake+MSBuild on the EDOPro side invokes vcpkg's protoc via a prebuild step).
#
# Cross-version gencode compatibility is strict in protobuf's modern runtime
# (PROTOBUF_VERSION must match exactly between gencode and runtime), and our
# two build systems source protobuf from different registries with different
# version catalogs, so committing the generated files was untenable. See
# src/docs/phase_p1_primitive_1_plan.md §1.3 for the full reasoning.
*.pb.cc
*.pb.h
